id=y700_coloros_stock_thermal
name=Y700 Gen 4 ColorOS Stock Thermal
version=1.1
versionCode=11
author=Codex for lorana
description=Restores only the stock Lenovo TB322 ZUXOS CPU, GPU and battery thermal-engine profiles, with the vendor SELinux context required by thermal-engine. Does not change display FPS policy, refresh rate, touch sampling, HAL, kernel or DTBO.
